Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg/3840px-Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg/1920px-Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1600,"height":1200,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d5/Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg/3840px-Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Lord_Mallieswara%2C_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lord_Mallieswara,_Goad_Of_Attappady.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/page/171149974","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-07-31 13:46:38","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Lord Mallieswara, Goad Of Attappady","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"CC-Zero|Self-published work|Uploaded via Campaign:wle-in|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|Images from Wiki Loves Earth missing SDC depicts|Images from Wiki Loves Earth missing SDC location of creation|Images from Wiki Loves Earth 2025|Images from Wiki Loves Earth 2025 in India|Images from Wiki Loves Earth with different SDC participant in|Images from Wiki Loves Earth 2025 Human Rights and Environment Special Nomination|Images from Wiki Loves Earth 2025 in India (Working)","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"GPSLatitude":{"value":"11.093127","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSLongitude":{"value":"76.575677","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Mallishwara Mudi \u2013 The Sacred Peak of Attappady\n<p>Mallishwara Mudi (\u0d2e\u0d32\u0d4d\u0d32\u0d3f\u0d36\u0d4d\u0d35\u0d30 \u0d2e\u0d41\u0d1f\u0d3f) is a prominent mountain peak located in the Attappady region of Palakkad district, Kerala, India. Rising majestically in the backdrop of the Silent Valley biosphere, this peak holds deep spiritual and cultural significance for the local tribal communities, especially the Irula and Muduga tribes.\n</p><p>The name Mallishwara is believed to be derived from \"Mallikarjuna,\" a form of Lord Shiva. The mountain is revered as a sacred abode of Lord Shiva, and when viewed from certain angles\u2014especially during early morning or dusk\u2014the silhouette of the peak strikingly resembles the matted hair (jata) of Lord Shiva, evoking imagery of his iconic conical hair-knot.\n</p><p>Geographical Significance:\nLocation: Attappady, Palakkad, Kerala\n</p><p>Range: Nilgiri Hills, part of the Western Ghats\n</p><p>Closest Wildlife Area: Silent Valley National Park\n</p><p>Elevation: Approx. 1,600\u20131,800 meters (unofficial estimate)\n</p><p>Cultural Importance:\nWorshipped by indigenous tribal communities\n</p><p>Considered the \u2018Thirumudi\u2019 (sacred crown) of Lord Shiva\n</p><p>Pilgrimages and traditional offerings are made to the mountain from the foothills\n</p><p>Tribal legends narrate the presence of divine energy in the mountain\u2019s core\n</p><p>In the Photograph:\n</p>\nThe provided image captures the front view of Mallishwara Mudi under natural sunlight. The sharp central peak symbolizes the divine form of Shiva\u2019s hair-lock (jata), and the surrounding landscape enhances its serene and mystical presence. The green meadow in the foreground opens up to the dramatic silhouette of the hills, making it a spiritual and natural marvel of Kerala.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2023-05-28 15:36:19","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Listener_in_peace&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Listener in peace (page does not exist)\">Listener in peace</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Zero, Public Domain Dedication","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]}}}}